msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 害人是有风险的工作."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 别看着我! 我可不是到处诅咒别人的人."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 安静点, 孩子!"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我真希望她会拒绝我. 她是个蛇蝎心肠的女人."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我做到了我的承诺. 这个季节已经结束了, 而安东夫人一次派对也没参加."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我不是给过你一个圣约翰的保护根吗."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我认识一个女仆."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我猜她有生意要做."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Jessie: I was so angry. The things that I did -- the way I made Mrs. Anton suffer. Then I never even got paid for it! If anyone deserved a curse, it was Delphine LaLaurie. The Loa had to be on my side!\n"
"Jessie: I made up my mind to cast the worse curse I'd ever heard of. I would call upon Damballah and invoke the Curse of Fire.\n"
"Jessie: You can find it here, in this shop... As I did. Find the curse. Find the curse."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我想过要用腹蛇诅咒."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 我会把你的秘密带进坟墓的."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 如果这位女士生病就不能去参加派对了, 对吗?"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 房子上写着呢, 不是吗? 你想要什么?"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 只要在三点的时候往她的茶里放一小撮. 你发誓!"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 现在你听着, 贝拉."
msgstr ""

msgid "Jessie: Oh, this fearsome place! So much wickedness went on here. You listen now. There are 8 ghosts trapped here, sorrow-bound. Use my Reveal Spirits spell to find 'em. They'll help you get into the gazebo. Quickly!%\")"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 跑吧, 戴尔芬! 火焰, 它们会找到你的."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Jessie: See that mirror near the windows? \n"
"Somethin' that happened right here in \n"
"this room is trapped in there. \n"
"The spirits are blockin' the glass. \n"
"But, listen now, you cast daylight on the mirror \n"
"and they'll flee for sure. \n"
"Daylight. Remember."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 是的. 我告诉她不行. 但是我认为, 也许我们并不是朋友."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 成交."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 现在说吧."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 那就最好. 这是药."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 那是危险的工作. 要付出很大的代价."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 价钱是150美元."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 那么你应该按我们约定的, 付给我125美元."
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 乱嚼舌头!"
msgstr ""

msgid "杰西: 好吧, 看在钱的份上. 我去拿我的披肩."
msgstr ""

